  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d via den afghanska nationella budgeten till utbildningssektorn.   Programmet syftar till att f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra kvaliteten inom skolan, bygga    skolor, utbilda l&#xe4;rare samt att st&#xe4;rka administrationen inom          utbildningsministeriet.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support through the Afghan national budget to an Education Quality    Improvement Programme (EQUIP), which aims to improve quality in       schools, construct schools, train teachers and strenghten the         administration wihtin the Ministry of Education.</narrative>
  </description>
